gine/godot/issues/comments/4679887460","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120188#issuecomment-4679887460","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120188","id":4679887460,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFvFqZA","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T11:07:13Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T11:07:13Z","body":"This is the same issue as #87690.\nIn the MRP the Fill's `StylBoxFlat.border_color` is the same as the Background's `StyleBoxFlat.bg_color`:\n<img width=\"682\" height=\"599\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8af1d04-760a-47ad-b3d0-064a98981bad\" />\n\nThis produces an illusion like it's the background's corner changing in size, but it's the fill's border:\n\n<img width=\"969\" height=\"706\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/42c15dcc-77c1-4cf1-a969-c80faeff4e50\" />|<img width=\"969\" height=\"706\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/371c167a-7d5e-47ee-8205-153b39e55650\" />|<img width=\"969\" height=\"706\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/106c4c20-39c7-4e99-80ee-b83e07b05267\" />\n-|-|-\n\nThanks for the report, closing as duplicate of #87690.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4679887460/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4682066672","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120188#issuecomment-4682066672","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120188","id":4682066672,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFxKq8A","user":{"login":"zorro0799","id":8001326,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgwMDEzMjY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8001326?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799","html_url":"https://github.com/zorro0799","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zorro0799/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T15:13:47Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T15:13:47Z","body":"The reason why the inner rectangle needs to have its side color and width set is mainly because there's no way to set the spacing between the inner and outer rectangles. If there were, this requirement wouldn't exist.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4682066672/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4683652259","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/120188#issuecomment-4683652259","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/120188","id":4683652259,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFyrcow","user":{"login":"kleonc","id":9283098,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjkyODMwOTg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9283098?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc","html_url":"https://github.com/kleonc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kleonc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-06-11T18:19:03Z","updated_at":"2026-06-11T18:19:03Z","body":"> The reason why the inner rectangle needs to have its side color and width set is mainly because there's no way to set the spacing between the inner and outer rectangles. If there were, this requirement wouldn't exist.\n\nYou could use the same workaround using a transparent border color for the fill StyleBox (it still suffers from #87690 but might be an acceptable solution for now🤔).\n\n- Fill's `border_color` the same as the background's `bg_color`:\n<img width=\"834\" height=\"383\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6d9a21cf-6636-4ff6-bceb-75306f5aef41\" />\n\n- Fill's `border_color` being transparent:\n<img width=\"812\" height=\"388\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2738934a-d363-4b58-95aa-8735b0ed6545\" />\n\n---\n\nAlternatively you could try no border for the fill StyleBox and non-zero `expand_margin` for the background StyleBox. This would result in the ProgressBar visually exceed its rect though, which might be undesired.\n\n<img width=\"340\" height=\"702\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c702892a-58ed-4d8c-9bbf-c151ffac2a0d\" />|<img width=\"335\" height=\"750\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a430ad0-3830-4430-8931-adb324f437e5\" />\n-|-\n\n<img width=\"912\" height=\"307\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f5035e01-aea1-4295-a7ef-e3c7ae27614e\" />","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/4683652259/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]